sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Worker as Sync Worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Match as MatchingEngine
    participant Projection as EffectiveRoleProjection
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant Outbox as Outbox

    Worker->>DB: Claim pending User Group job
    DB-->>Worker: Current source version

    Worker->>Match: rebuild Group membership
    Match->>DB: Evaluate matching population
    DB-->>Match: Employee rows
    Match-->>Worker: Membership diff

    Worker->>DB: Apply membership additions/removals

    loop Affected employees
        Worker->>Projection: recompute effective Roles
        Projection->>DB: Persist effective Role projection
        Projection->>Redis: Replace user authorization cache
    end

    Worker->>DB: Set projection version = source version
    Worker->>DB: Mark job COMPLETED
    Worker->>Outbox: Append sync-completed event
